{
 "texts": {
  "comp-lvb4yz9p": "<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:80px;\"><span style=\"font-size:80px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Luxurious Rooms:</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:70px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Where Every View is a Masterpiece</span></h1>",
  "comp-lvb505yb": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"text-align:justify; font-size:18px;\">Welcome to our luxurious retreat where every aspect is meticulously designed to offer you an unparalleled experience. Our resort boasts three air-conditioned bedrooms, each uniquely showcasing a breathtaking view of our lush tea plantation. With expansive glass doors and windows, you&#39;ll enjoy the best vistas right from the comfort of your room. Experience the epitome of luxury and natural beauty at our homestay.</p>",
  "comp-lvamf0z7": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px; line-height:normal;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica-w01-bold,helvetica-w02-bold,helvetica-lt-w10-bold,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Room 1</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf0z7__item1": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px; line-height:normal;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica-w01-bold,helvetica-w02-bold,helvetica-lt-w10-bold,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Room 1</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf0z7__item2": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica-w01-bold,helvetica-w02-bold,helvetica-lt-w10-bold,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Room 2</span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf0z7__item3": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica-w01-bold,helvetica-w02-bold,helvetica-lt-w10-bold,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Room 3</span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf10c": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">With panoramic glass windows offering a rich view of the surroundings, a shaded balcony providing easy access to the pool under the canopy of a mango tree, and an attached toilet featuring a stunning glass window framing mountain sunsets, every moment here is a blend of luxury and natural beauty, ensuring an unforgettable stay.</span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf10c__item1": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">With panoramic glass windows offering a rich view of the surroundings, a shaded balcony providing easy access to the pool under the canopy of a mango tree, and an attached toilet featuring a stunning glass window framing mountain sunsets, every moment here is a blend of luxury and natural beauty, ensuring an unforgettable stay.</span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf10c__item2": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Step onto your private grass lawn and enjoy sunset chats with a refreshing breeze. With easy access to the grill house and tea plantation walk, every moment here is filled with relaxation and exploration. Plus, the attached toilet&#39;s glass window offers a wide view of the hills, adding to the charm of your stay.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvamf10c__item3": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_36 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Our largest and most luxurious accommodation at the homestay. This spacious room features a side glass window that offers a stunning view of our lush garden, creating a serene ambience. With direct access to the infinity pool, you can easily unwind and enjoy a refreshing dip whenever you please. It is designed for ultimate comfort and relaxation.</span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvif1chc": "<h2 class=\"font_4 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:40px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:40px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Booking Policies &amp;<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nGuidelines</span></span></h2>",
  "comp-lvif4mny": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Please note that all activities related to fireworks are strictly prohibited on our property and its premises.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Bookings will be only confirmed upon receipt of advance payment.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● On weekends, we prioritize full-property bookings. (Friday, Saturday&amp; Sunday).</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● We kindly request you to confirm your booking as soon as possible. For multiple inquiries on the same day, bookings will be processed on a first-come, first-served basis.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Please note, all guests must share their valid ID proof during check-in.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Children above 6 years old will be considered in the adult category and will be charged accordingly.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Check In:14:00 Hrs&nbsp; &nbsp;&amp; Check-Out: 11:00 Hrs&nbsp; ( IST)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Early check-in &amp; Late check-out is subject to availability and will be chargeable. Checkouts from 11:00 to 18:00 hours are subject to 50% of the room rate and after that at 100%.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Please complete the balance payment procedure during the check-in time.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Please remember, that the number of guests must not exceed as mentioned in the confirmation. During the stay, no guests other than those who have made a reservation may enter the property.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● We kindly request that guests confirm their food choices two days before arrival. The menu lists will be provided to you when booking for your convenience.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp;</span>For the health, safety, and quality standards of our guests, we do not permit outside food on our property.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Complimentary breakfast is provided, and guests can select up to three main courses from the food menu.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Negotiation is not possible after reaching the property.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● The late check-in must be informed to the property manager.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Early check-in &amp; Late check-out are subject to availability and must be informed beforehand.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Smoking and alcohol consumption is allowed in designated areas only.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● We strictly prohibit all illegal activities, including gambling, prostitution, and narcotics.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Damage to the property caused by the guest will be charged at the cost of repair or replacement.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● We appreciate your cooperation and respect for the property staff. They are here to help you and make your stay comfortable. Please treat them with kindness and courtesy.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Please take care of yourself if you engage in adventure activities on the property.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● We kindly request you to take good care of your belongings. We are not liable for any loss or damage that may occur. Make sure you pick up all your personal belongings before checking out.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● If you have ordered the BBQ and campfire will depend on the weather and availability. If the bonfire and barbecue cannot take place due to the weather, the costs will be refunded</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Kindly note that our homestay is not pet-friendly.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.8em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Food and beverages will only be served at designated areas on the property.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.8em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● Jeep safari and trekking activities are subject to availability and should be requested during the booking process. Please note that these activities incur additional charges.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">All the special requests by the guest are subject to availability upon arrival.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.8em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● For any disputes in payments and any other legal disputes, the jurisdiction of the court will be at Muttom in Idukki district Kerala</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
  "comp-lvvtr581": "<h2 class=\"font_4 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:40px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:40px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Cancellation Policy</span></span></h2>",
  "comp-lvvts39q": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In case of no show or cancellation of the reservation, the resort has the right to levy retention charges.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">● </span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\">Guests who cancel their reservation at least 7 days before arrival will receive a 90% refund of the advance amount.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp;</span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\">Guests who cancel their reservation at least 3 days before arrival will receive a 50% refund of the advance amount.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Cancellations before 0-3 days before the arrival are not entitled to a refund.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#242323;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:brandon-grot-w01-light,brandon-grot-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"color_42 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Reservations cancelled between December 20th and January 10th are not eligible for any refund.</span></span></p>"
 },
